Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 22:35:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 27/37] Product questions get the product behind
 SEQUENCE_TEACH_PRODUCT_MODE=1, and a bench to A/B it

A teach turn asking what the product is, why it exists, how it works or its advantages gets a
newcomer's answer shape (read the README first; what, who, why, 5 steps, advantages), a concept
flow chart instead of a file chart, no derived file quiz, and the start of its own last answer
so it is not sent again. Off by default. 3 unit tests; tools/bench/product-question-ab.mjs
replays the owner's three questions plus the same shape on shopfront and makemore.
